;; resolve_jurisdiction.aura — Origin-vs-destination jurisdiction pick
;; Public API: (api resolve-jurisdiction ship-to nexus)
;;   ship-to : alist with (state, county, city)
;;   nexus   : list of nexus alists from (api load-nexus-rules)
;; Returns a jurisdiction id string, or #f if no nexus applies.
;;
;; Logic:
;;   - If the seller has no nexus in the ship-to state, return #f.
;;   - If the seller's nexus in that state is origin-based (e.g., OR, NH),
;;     the seller does NOT collect destination tax: return #f.
;;   - Otherwise (destination-based), pick the most-specific applicable jid:
;;       city match  -> "jid-<state>-<city-slug>"
;;       county only -> "jid-<state>-<county-slug>"
;;       state only  -> "jid-<state>-state"
;;     Exact, case-insensitive matching against the seller
;;
